+
+  pqp (2026-10-20): co_derive and co_serializable added. bsnes calls co_derive on
+  every power cycle after the first (reset, and loading a state) and
+  co_serializable on every state save; without them the emscripten link leaves
+  both as stubs that abort the runtime. Each fiber now keeps its own stacks so
+  co_derive can re-initialise it in place and co_delete can free all of it.
+  This file stays public domain.
